      <h1 id="wo-01-implementation-evidence">WO-01 implementation evidence</h1>
<h2 id="summary">Summary</h2>
<ul><li>Authorized scope: WO-01/R01/R10 code and tests only. No production access, deployment, live migration or protected-branch merge.</li><li>Baseline: <code>9fae3248aadecaa53198a5fb9f06576fdcc182cf</code>, branch <code>hudhud_fm</code>; initial tracked tree clean.</li><li>Node gates use installed Node <code>22.23.3</code>; PATH default Node26 is not used for application acceptance.</li><li>C01 contract independently reviewed; deletion-precondition and legacy-conflict clarifications incorporated before fixes.</li><li>R01 and R10 remain <strong>OPEN</strong>. Code and local proof do not establish live-data cleanup.</li></ul>
<h2 id="execution-and-locks">Execution and locks</h2>
<p>I owns the shared contracts, Rules/tests and delete source. BE owns the unique partition/save/helper tests and real editorial emulator test. Runtime E is exclusive to I. All other work orders remain unexecuted. B01 executes C01 only; its WO-03/04 milestones are outside this authorization.</p>
<h2 id="actual-evidence">Actual evidence</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Result</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>B02 original existing-boundary RED</td><td>44 cases:34 pass,10 intended assertion failures,0 skips</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-privacy-baseline-red.log</code></td></tr><tr><td>B02 C01-aligned RED</td><td>44 cases:32 pass,12 intended behavior failures; no setup failure counted</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-C01-baseline-red.log</code></td></tr><tr><td>Functions owning-package GREEN</td><td>192 passed,0 failed/skipped</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-functions-full-test.log</code></td></tr><tr><td>Functions lint and explicit new-helper syntax</td><td>Passed</td><td><code>B02-functions-lint.log</code>, <code>B02-helper-syntax.log</code> in evidence directory</td></tr><tr><td>Rules baseline RED</td><td>35 cases:33 pass,2 intended super-admin private-read denials,0 skips</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-rules-red.log</code></td></tr><tr><td>Rules GREEN</td><td>35 passed,0 failed/skipped</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-rules-green.log</code></td></tr><tr><td>Independent source review</td><td>No concrete B02 bypass/regression; independent70/70 focused tests pass</td><td>Reviewer <code>wo01_b02_independent_review</code>, source hashes retained below</td></tr><tr><td>Real editorial transaction/rollback/concurrency GREEN</td><td>51 passed,0 failed/skipped</td><td><code>evidence/WO-01/B02-editorial-green.log</code>, including10 new both-root cases</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>The initial sandbox-localhost startup failure was environmental, was not counted as RED, and was rerun with approved emulator permissions. No pending/failed integration check is treated as PASS.</p>
