<h3 id="outstanding-acceptance-and-approvals">Outstanding acceptance and approvals</h3>
<p>R01 and R10 remain <strong>OPEN</strong>. The 17 registered skipped emulator identities remain explicit acceptance obligations; no skip has been converted into passing evidence. Full Flutter tests, physical-device acceptance, B15 cross-component integration, and remaining independent/integration gates remain pending. Production backup location/retention, migration and rollout approvals remain separate and ungranted. No production checkpoint has been executed. The B03 lint failure is the immediate local blocker.</p>
